WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:02.100
Film Courage: And so, what’s your connect
to the film tonight?

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.460
You are in this movie [THE EAST].

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:04.770
What made you say “yes” to the role?

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:10.290
Actress Danielle Macdonald: It’s an amazing
script and I would never turn it down.

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:11.520
It was amazing.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:15.070
The experience was even better than the script.

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:20.110
It was just one of those things that made
it an incredible experience with such a great

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:21.310
group with such amazing actors.

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:22.390
Film Courage: [Referring to the theme of the
film THE EAST regarding anarchist groups known

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:25.000
for executing attacks on major corporations]
In terms of anarchy, how far would you go

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.350
for a role such as what would you do to obtain
information, or get yourself seen in front

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:31.660
of a casting director?

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.340
What type of extreme measures would you take?

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:37.370
Danielle Macdonald: [Laughs] I mean…I’m
not very extreme.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:40.690
I’m a little more on the flip side.

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:44.020
I want to go in there and do the best that
I can do and if that’s right, that’s right.

